+
+            // And give it the keyboard. Every shortcut the 3D view has -
+            // copy, paste, delete, the camera views, the gizmo letters - is a
+            // wxEVT_CHAR handler on this canvas, so it only ever fires while
+            // the canvas holds the focus. On a desktop the pointer arrives
+            // first and GLCanvas3D::on_mouse() takes the focus on the way
+            // past; on a tablet the user can perfectly well pick Prepare from
+            // the tab bar and then reach for the keyboard without ever having
+            // touched the plate, and nothing would have happened.
+            //
+            // Not done when a text field is being typed into: switching page
+            // does not take the keyboard away from an editor the user opened.
+            wxWindow *const focus = wxWindow::FindFocus();
